          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs text-ink/50 font-light mb-3">
            <span>June 2, 2026</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
            <span>7 min read</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-ink leading-snug" style="font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.6rem); letter-spacing: -0.025em;">
            <a
              href="/insights/why-violin-lessons-should-feel-supportive-denver"
              class="hover:text-purplePrimary transition-colors duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-purplePrimary rounded"
            >
              Why Violin Lessons Should Feel Supportive, Not Intimidating
